# Source manifest: {{COURSE}} {{EXAM}}

One row per source file. **These rows are the one statement of scope:** `CLAUDE.md` and
`PLAN.md` point here and never restate it. A scope change is made here, then carried to every
product (the notes' "Not on {{EXAM}}" banners, the sheets, the cram order, the mock totals). Counts
come from disk (`pdfinfo`, `ls`), never from memory.

